  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently World Constraints are dropped like a particle\n\nIf the Avi is Off the Object will only be dropped were the Avi is locally when it's turned on\n\nSo this leads the Object being in a different spot for everyone\n\nA Synced World Constraint will always be in the same spot for everyone\n\nThe sync it's static not changing position and would only be On or Off not a variable Weight\n\nAny more desired Constraint complexity can be stacked under with Regular Constraints\n\nThis would allow one to make synced buildings and other things that benefit from a Static Synced Reference Point for an Object to be based off of",
